31
00:01:12,513 --> 00:01:14,081
They're gonna bring her
back to us.

32
00:01:15,215 --> 00:01:16,550
I fucking love Mark Tuello!

33
00:01:16,550 --> 00:01:18,852
I fucking love
Mark Tuello!

34
